    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="73a2deaa-91d2-59ff-a917-ece7f5de2957" activityNameId="0957c13f-490c-53b0-ae3e-ed4f2d67e205" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Process-specific burdens, hazardous waste incineration plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Process-specific burdens, hazardous waste incineration plant
Constant for every kilogram of waste;
Synonyms: HWI, SAVA; 
UUID: d052f1df-c0b7-4030-b6a6-4cdb4897d573
Burdens independent of the waste composition are inventoried. These depend on the manner the incineration is performend and not on the material. Includes burdens from DeNOx for abatement of thermal NOx.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Swiss HWI plant in 2000 with wet flue gas scrubber and low-dust SCR DeNOx facility. 
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 2 Swiss HWI plants with a total capacity of 53'000 t/a.
Sampling: The 2 Swiss HWI plants, used as the inventory reference technology mix, have a total annual capacity of 53'000 tons of hazardous waste. This corresonds to 39% of the Swiss total installed capacity in 2000. Swiss average plants size is 20'000 t/a. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d052f1df-c0b7-4030-b6a6-4cdb4897d573.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
